* Glowing Crystal — CESHAD shader agent (classifier 2 21 42005).
*
* PICK IT UP and it shrinks to carry size; DROP it in the world and it grows
* back. Dropped into the inventory drawer it STAYS small — that is what fits:
* the vehicle cabin check (AgentManager.cpp) rejects any agent wider or taller
* than the cabin. Pickup/drop is the trigger rather than a click, because a
* click on a carryable agent is taken by the Hand as a pick-up, so activate 1
* never arrives.
*
* The shrink is done by the SHADER: the effect's size param is in PIXELS, so it
* is eased down while the agent stays on the full 128x160 frame and the effect
* closes smoothly. SHDR params interpolate in the engine (DrawableObject holds a
* target and the draw bracket eases toward it), so setting a value animates it.
*
* Because that size is in pixels rather than sprite-UV, the same value means the
* same on-screen effect on EITHER frame — so the swap to the 76x96 carry pose
* needs no shader change at all, and there is no frame of the bare black
* surrogate showing through.
*
* PUHL gives each pose its own carry handle (both at the frame centre) so the
* hold point does not jump. While carried the CARRIER owns the position, so the
* script must not mvto — it only re-centres on a drop in the world.
*
* NB: CAOS comments must be on their OWN line — a trailing "*" comment after a
* command silently aborts the rest of the script.
new: simp 2 21 42005 "crystal" 2 0 8999
* attr 3 = carryable(1) + mouseable(2)
attr 3
bhvr 0
puhl 0 64 80
puhl 1 38 48
shdr "crystal" { 0.45 0.8 1.0 2.0 128 }
* ov00: 0 = full size, 1 = carry size
setv ov00 0
seta va10 targ
targ pntr
setv va00 posl
setv va01 post
targ va10
subv va00 64
subv va01 80
mvto va00 va01

scrp 2 21 42005 4
  doif ov00 eq 0
    shdr "crystal" { 0.45 0.8 1.0 2.6 76 }
    wait 14
    pose 1
    setv ov00 1
  endi
endm

scrp 2 21 42005 5
  wait 3
  doif carr eq null
    doif ov00 eq 1
      pose 0
      setv va00 posl
      setv va01 post
      subv va00 26
      subv va01 32
      mvto va00 va01
      shdr "crystal" { 0.45 0.8 1.0 2.0 128 }
      setv ov00 0
    endi
  endi
endm

scrp 2 21 42005 128
  doif ov00 eq 1
    shdr "crystal" { 0.45 0.8 1.0 2.6 76 }
  else
    shdr "crystal" { 0.45 0.8 1.0 2.0 128 }
  endi
endm
